**Owner B1 artifact:** [Draft PR #394](https://github.com/ArdenZC/Zen-Canvas/pull/394), independent docs-only research, HEAD `fc1550b96f55812213f09fa0e5912a6ec0a04ca1`, Tree `7fcc2609f09d73128719adaf37c07b54e15e130d`, two commits ahead of unchanged master, three new files +586/-0 in `docs/project/research/issue-381-b1/`:
